                <p>I am Fydar Avery, a Staff-level games programmer with <b>9 years and 6 months</b> of professional <b>Unity</b> and <b>C#</b> experience. Across <a href="@explicitBaseUri/#titles" class="textual-link" target="_blank">11 commercial titles<SvgSprite Link="/icons.svg?v=1#icon-external-link" class="external-link-icon" /></a> shipped on PC, Android, iOS, and console, I have owned features end to end – from gameplay on the device to the editor tools, backend services, and data driving it.</p>

